        "shared_rejection_diagnosis_divergence": "Rater a2 correctly identifies that the original relationship distorts the meaning of the text. Rater a1 incorrectly suggests that 'pond -be-> official' is correct, which contradicts the text's statement that there are no official criteria distinguishing between ponds and lakes."
    }
